  "title": "Q102 문제 풀이 · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "Which statement best distinguishes Snowball Edge from AWS DataSync for an existing customer?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>문제 풀이</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 102</p><h1>문제 풀이</h1></div><strong>102 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"102번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:94%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q102\" data-question=\"Q102\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q102</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which statement best distinguishes Snowball Edge from AWS DataSync for an existing customer?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q102\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Both services require a continuously available high-bandwidth internet link</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q102\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Snowball Edge can provide local compute and physically transport data, while DataSync moves data over a network</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q102\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">DataSync ships encrypted appliances, while Snowball Edge is a software agent</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q102\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Neither service can move data to Amazon S3</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a>는 물리 장치로 데이터 운송과 현장 컴퓨팅을 지원한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#aws-datasync\">DataSync</a>는 네트워크를 통한 온라인 전송 서비스다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">DataSync / Snow Family</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q101/\">이전 문제 <b>Q101</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q103/\">다음 문제 <b>Q103</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
